title: munir_topic_player_to_character_why_were_we_created
tags: actor:Munir actor:Prince
---
Prince: But why were we created?

Munir: I'm glad you asked.
Munir: Allah said in the Quran: "I did not create jinn and humans except to worship Me."
Munir: Our main purpose as people is to worship Allah.

<<RemovePlayerToCharacterTopic "Munir" "why were we created">>
