title: munir_topic_player_to_character_what_is_worship
tags: actor:Munir actor:Prince
---
Prince: What is worship?

Munir: Worship is a broad term.
Munir: It doesn't just mean to pray only.

Munir: It means to obey Allah.
Munir: To do what Allah has ordered.
Munir: To avoid what Allah has forbidden.
Munir: And to do so with love and exaltation.
