title: munir_topic_player_to_character_how_do_you_know_allah
tags: actor:Munir actor:Prince
---
Prince: But how do you know about Allah?
Prince: How are you certain of Him?

Munir: I'm glad you asked.
Munir: There are 2 main ways.

Munir: Through His creation and through His revelations.

Prince: How's that?

Munir: All of creation point towards the Creator.

-> Prince: That makes sense
    Prince: I feel like it makes sense.
-> Prince: But why?
    <<detour munir_detour_raft_story>>
    Prince: I feel like it make sense to me now.

Munir: I'm glad it does.

Prince: What about revelations?

Munir: Revelations are what has been revealed to us from Allah. 
Munir: From the Quran, our book.
Munir: And from the Sunnah.
===

title: munir_detour_raft_story
tags: actor:Munir actor:Prince
---
Prince: But why?
Prince: How are you sure about that?

Munir: Consider this.
Munir: Allah said "Or were they created by nothing..."
Munir: "...or are they their own creators?"
Munir: Were we created by nothing?
Munir: Or did we create ourselves?

Prince: Why can't we have been created from nothing? 
Prince: Why can't the world just, you know, came to be?

Munir: Let me tell you a story from my youth.
Munir: I once was late to class. I woke up too late.
Munir: And I needed to cross the river.
Munir: Unfortunately, there was no bridge.
Munir: I sat around, worried about missing my class.
Munir: Then, suddenly...
Munir: A gust of wind blew!
Munir: It broke off branches from a tree.
Munir: And all of them fell on the ground.
Munir: But in such a way, that it formed a small, but simple raft.
Munir: I was so happy!
Munir: I managed to cross the river safely and get to class.

Prince: That's nonsense.
Munir: Why not?
Munir: I got to class that day!
Prince: That just doesn't happen!
Munir: It did to me.
Prince: You must be lying.
Munir: Why is that? 
Prince: How does it just happen that a raft formed by itself?
Prince: From a gust of wind?
Prince: That branches JUST happen to fall like that?
Prince: That's absurd!

Munir: Let me ask you this question.
Munir: If you think that a small and simple raft could not have formed all by itself...
Munir: ... why would you think that the world could have just formed all by itself? From nothing?

Munir: Were we created from nothing? 
Munir: What's so difficult to believe about the raft?
Munir: Think about it.
===


